From: meta-st-odyssey <build@local>
Date: Fri, 12 Sep 2026 00:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32mp157c-odyssey: MAC-level PHY reset with
 long settle delay (mickledore-era fix)

The KSZ9031RN never answered the MDIO bus ("MDIO device at address 7
is missing", stmmac_open failing with -ENODEV) with mainline's
default per-PHY reset-gpios/reset-assert-us/reset-deassert-us
(10000us assert / only 300us deassert-to-scan). Confirmed by direct
serial testing that this is NOT a probe-ordering/PMIC-timing race
(unbind/rebind 10+ minutes after boot, PMIC long since up, fails
identically) and NOT fixed by removing the GPIO reset assertion
entirely either (tested, no change) - the actual problem is that
300us is nowhere near long enough for the KSZ9031RN's internal PLL
to stabilize after reset deassertion before the single-shot,
no-retry MDIO ID scan runs.

This is the exact fix carried by this board's last known-working
mickledore-era kernel patch (0002-fix-change-VCO-from-594MHz-to-750MHz-for-eth-phy.patch,
mingzq <north_sea@qq.com>, dropped without replacement during the
scarthgap port): move the reset to the MAC level via
snps,reset-gpio/snps,reset-active-low/snps,reset-delays-us, which
stmmac_mdio_reset() honors as
<startup-delay, assert-duration, post-deassert-settle> in
microseconds - 30ms assert, 50ms settle before the MDIO scan, instead
of mainline's 300us. Also renames mdio -> mdio0 to match.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [out-of-tree board]

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157c-odyssey.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157c-odyssey.dts
@@ -42,15 +42,17 @@
 	assigned-clock-rates = <125000000>; /* Clock PLL4 to 750Mhz in ATF/U-Boot */
 	st,eth-clk-sel;

-	mdio {
+	snps,reset-gpio = <&gpiog 0 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+	snps,reset-active-low;
+	snps,reset-delays-us = <0 30000 50000>;
+
+	mdio0 {
 		#address-cells = <1>;
 		#size-cells = <0>;
 		compatible = "snps,dwmac-mdio";
+
 		phy0: ethernet-phy@7 { /* KSZ9031RN */
 			reg = <7>;
-			reset-gpios = <&gpiog 0 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>; /* ETH_RST# */
-			reset-assert-us = <10000>;
-			reset-deassert-us = <300>;
 		};
 	};
 };
